      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d 秒后可重发"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resend in %d seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 无效或已失效，请在设置中更新当前服务商的 API Key。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 无效或已失效，请在设置中更新当前服务商的 API Key。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key is invalid or expired. Update it in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API 可用额度不足，请在服务商平台检查额度、余额和用量上限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 可用额度不足，请在服务商平台检查额度、余额和用量上限。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API quota is insufficient. Check your provider's quota, balance and usage limits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API 服务地址无法使用，请在设置中检查 Base URL，使用以 http:// 或 https:// 开头的接口地址。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 服务地址无法使用，请在设置中检查 Base URL，使用以 http:// 或 https:// 开头的接口地址。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API address is invalid. Check Base URL in Settings and use an address beginning with http:// or https://."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API 服务证书不受系统信任，已停止连接。请检查是否有代理拦截，或联系服务商处理证书。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 服务证书不受系统信任，已停止连接。请检查是否有代理拦截，或联系服务商处理证书。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API certificate is not trusted and the connection was stopped. Check for proxy interception or contact the provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API 服务证书已过期或尚未生效，请检查系统日期和时间；时间正确时，请联系服务商处理证书。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 服务证书已过期或尚未生效，请检查系统日期和时间；时间正确时，请联系服务商处理证书。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API certificate has expired or is not yet valid. Check your system date and time, then contact the provider if necessary."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API 认证未通过，请在设置中检查 API Key 是否填写、有效且属于当前服务商。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 认证未通过，请在设置中检查 API Key 是否填写、有效且属于当前服务商。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API authentication failed. Check that your API key is present, valid, and belongs to this provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API 账户余额不足，请在服务商平台检查余额或充值后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 账户余额不足，请在服务商平台检查余额或充值后重试。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your API account balance is insufficient. Check or add funds with your provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
