    "TLS 安全连接失败，请检查网络或代理后重试；若持续出现，请联系服务商确认连接兼容性。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TLS 安全连接失败，请检查网络或代理后重试；若持续出现，请联系服务商确认连接兼容性。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The TLS connection failed. Check your network or proxy and retry; if it continues, ask the provider about connection compatibility."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TLS 数据校验失败，安全连接已中断。请检查网络或代理后重试；若持续出现，请联系服务商。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TLS 数据校验失败，安全连接已中断。请检查网络或代理后重试；若持续出现，请联系服务商。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TLS data validation failed and the secure connection was stopped. Check your network or proxy, then retry or contact the provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TranslateHUD 设置": {
