    "TranslateHUD 需要两项权限": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TranslateHUD 需要两项权限"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TranslateHUD Needs Two Permissions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 屏幕录制：用于截取屏幕区域并 OCR\n• 辅助功能：用于读取其他应用中的选中文字\n\n点击下方按钮跳转系统设置 → 隐私与安全性，找到 TranslateHUD 后开启对应开关。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 屏幕录制：用于截取屏幕区域并 OCR\n• 辅助功能：用于读取其他应用中的选中文字\n\n点击下方按钮跳转系统设置 → 隐私与安全性，找到 TranslateHUD 后开启对应开关。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Screen Recording: capture a screen area for text recognition\n• Accessibility: read selected text in other apps\n\nUse the buttons below to open System Settings → Privacy & Security and enable the relevant permissions for TranslateHUD."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与服务的连接中断，译文可能不完整。请检查网络或代理后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与服务的连接中断，译文可能不完整。请检查网络或代理后重试。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection was interrupted and the translation may be incomplete. Check your network or proxy and retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
